Description: compiler and tools for the Scala 2.13 programming language
 Scala is a programming language that scales with you: from small
 scripts to large multiplatform applications.
 .
 This package provides the Scala 2.13 compiler (scalac), runner and
 interactive shell (scala), the documentation tool (scaladoc), the fast
 offline compiler (fsc) and the class-file decoder (scalap). It can be
 installed together with the Scala 2.12 package (scala); the commands are
 also available as scalac-2.13, scala-2.13, and so on.
 .
 It is built from source with no sbt, by a two-pass self-hosting build.

Package: scala-library-2.13
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Scala 2.13 standard library
 Scala is a programming language that scales with you: from small
 scripts to large multiplatform applications.
 .
 This package contains the Scala 2.13 standard library and reflection
 jars needed to run programs built with Scala 2.13. It can be installed
 together with scala-library (Scala 2.12).
